; A written-off car shutting the street. Same pickable arrangement as the other incidents
; -- layer 8, solid to nothing -- with one deliberate exception: the Blocker child is a
; real collider on layer 1, a squat square slab across the carriageway, because a street
; only reads as shut if a vehicle actually stalls against something. Square on purpose, so
; the same scene shuts a north-south or an east-west street. The car itself is laid out by
; Wreck.gd at runtime and collision-stripped as usual.

[gd_scene load_steps=5 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://Game/Incidents/Wreck.gd" id="1_script"]

